      "result": "Implemented the persistent Rails URL shortener API. It supports link creation, listing and lookup, plus redirects that increment click counts. `start.sh` runs pending migrations and serves on `0.0.0.0:8000`; the README explains startup.\n\nVerified the API with HTTP smoke checks covering generated and custom codes, conflicts, validation and malformed JSON, lookup and listing, unknown codes, redirects, and click counts. `bundle exec rails test` and `git diff --check` also passed. The smoke checks created and then removed their test links.",
